{"speciesId":753,"names":{"fr":"Mimantis","es":"Fomantis","en":"Fomantis","ja":"カリキリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"La journée, il passe son temps à flâner au soleil et à faire la sieste. Le soir venu, il part à la recherche d’un lieu plus sûr pour passer la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Mientras que de día duerme tranquilamente a la luz del sol, al caer la noche busca un sitio más seguro para dormir."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"During the day, it sleeps and soaks up light. When night falls, it walks around looking for a safer place to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"昼間は 光を浴びて 眠り 夜に なると より 安全な 寝床を 探し 歩き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Le corps de Mimantis dégage un léger parfum sucré, qui a le don d’attirer les Bombydou dans les hautes herbes où il se cache."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Desprende un aroma fresco y dulce. En la hierba alta donde se esconde también suelen acudir Cutiefly."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They give off a sweet and refreshing scent. Cutiefly often gather near the tall grass where Fomantis are hiding."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"爽やかで 甘い香りが する。 カリキリが 隠れている 草むらには よく アブリーが 群れている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Quand le jour se lève, il déploie ses quatre feuilles pour prendre un bain de soleil. Une odeur agréable émane du haut de sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Al salir el sol, expande sus cuatro hojas buscando la luz. De su cabeza emana un agradable aroma."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When the sun rises, Fomantis spreads its four leaves and bathes in the sunlight. The tip of its head has a pleasant aroma."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"日が 昇ると ４枚の 葉っぱを 広げ 日光浴。 頭の 先から いい 匂いが するよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il raffole de la lumière du jour. Sa couleur devient de plus en plus vive à mesure qu’il s’abreuve des rayons du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le encanta la luz solar. Cuanto más toma el sol, más llamativos son los colores que desarrolla."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It loves the sunshine. When it basks in the sunlight regularly, it grows up with vivid coloration."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"お日様の 光が 大好き。 しっかり 日光浴を することで 色鮮やかに 育っていくのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il dégage une odeur délicieuse quand il prend le soleil, ce qui attire tous les Pokémon Insecte des alentours."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando toma el sol, desprende un aroma muy dulce y agradable que atrae a multitud de Pokémon insecto."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When bathed in sunlight, this Pokémon emits a pleasantly sweet scent, which causes bug Pokémon to gather around it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"太陽の 光を 浴びると 甘く よい香りが するので 虫ポケモンたちが 寄ってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La journée, il dort tranquillement au soleil pour en absorber les rayons. La nuit, il se réveille et vaque à ses occupations."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"De día duerme tranquilamente a la luz del sol y, al ocaso, despierta e inicia su actividad nocturna."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"During the day, Fomantis basks in sunlight and sleeps peacefully. It wakes and moves around at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"昼間は 陽の 光を 浴び すやすやと 眠る。 夜中に 目を 覚まし 活動を はじめる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":753,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[17,"level-up",14],[18,"level-up",14],[20,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"razor-leaf","learns":[[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[17,"level-up",41],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",